File name: CRPTLOOP.MP
Path description: Full crypt loop (all three levels)
Path starts: Graveyard Crypt level 1
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Original Game
Level recommendation: 7-10
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: skeleton, zombie, shade, wight.
Additional information:

Included in this zip is CRSHCRY1.MP, which is used to re-start this loop
if it fails (ie the pull lever door closes before you reach it). Simply
add CRSHCRY1.MP as well as CRPTLOOP.MP and this path will do it's
re-starting automatically.

You can only use this loop if you are level 11 or below.
